    "transcript": {
      "transcript_id": "transcriptid-itinerary-0429",
      "state": "ready",
      "language": "en",
      "segments": [
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0001",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:30:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:30:00Z",
          "text": "Morning everyone — thanks for being on time. I want to keep us tight today, we've got four things to get through and I'd like to wrap by 11. Daniel, Mei, you good to dive in?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0002",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:30:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:31:00Z",
          "text": "Morning. Yep, ready.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0003",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:31:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:31:00Z",
          "text": "Hey Sofia, hey Daniel. Ready.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0004",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:31:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:32:00Z",
          "text": "Great. Agenda: flight carriers, room allocation, the deposit budget, and our payment and document deadlines. Let's start with carriers. Mei, you took the deeper look at the three airlines — which ones are we putting a group hold on?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0005",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:32:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:34:00Z",
          "text": "So I went through TAP Air Portugal, Iberia Airlines, and Vueling. Quick read: TAP has the best group fare into Lisbon — about $1,450 per traveler round trip with a checked bag, and their group fare counts as a scheduled carrier under our Allianz Travel group policy for trip-interruption cover. Iberia Airlines is at about $1,320 per traveler, the group-seating guarantee is weaker, but their on-time numbers into Seville are slightly better in the reviews I pulled. Vueling is the cheapest at roughly $980, but that's before bags and seat selection, and they won't hold a group block this far out, which I don't think works for sixteen of us.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0006",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:34:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:34:00Z",
          "text": "Yeah, I'd drop Vueling. The no-frills model is fine for a couple, but with four families and kids, people are going to expect bags and seats together without fighting for them.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0007",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:34:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "text": "Agreed. So we move TAP and Iberia to a formal group-fare request and drop Vueling?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0008",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "text": "Yes, that's my recommendation.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0009",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "text": "Plus one.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0010",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "text": "Good. Decision: TAP and Iberia go to a group-fare request, Vueling is out. Mei, can you draft the flight hold request this week and share it for review by Friday?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0011",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "text": "Will do. I'll have it in the shared folder by end of day Friday.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0012",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:37:00Z",
          "text": "Perfect. Item two — room allocation. I want to land on a number today. Daniel, what's your read?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0013",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:37:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:38:00Z",
          "text": "I've been going back and forth. Anything under seven rooms per city and we're cramming families into triples; anything over nine and we're paying for rooms nobody sleeps in. I'd land at eight. Enough for every family to have their own space, small enough that if a hotel falls through we can rebook without it being a scramble.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0014",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:38:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "text": "I'd second eight. And on which blocks — I'd suggest we use the Porto room block and the Seville room block we already have quotes on. Two reasons: those are the two cities where hotels sell out first in July, so locking them early matters most there, and they're both sized such that eight rooms fits cleanly without splitting us across two hotels.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0015",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "text": "That works for me. Any concern about Lisbon if we only lock those two blocks now?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0016",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "text": "Some, but Lisbon has more inventory. I think the trade-off is worth it. We can finalize Lisbon once flights are held.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0017",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "text": "Okay. Decision: eight rooms each in the Porto room block and the Seville room block, with a 4-week window for families to confirm their room preferences. Daniel, you'll own the room allocation?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0018",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "text": "Yep.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0019",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "text": "Good. Item three — the deposit budget. Rob confirmed the $48k pot is fully collected. Mei, how do we want to slice it?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0020",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "text": "I'd carve out $31k for flights, $13k for lodging — the Porto and Seville blocks plus the Lisbon deposit — and hold the remaining $4k for transfers, which at sixteen travelers covers the Lisbon airport pickup, the Porto-to-Seville coach, and the Seville airport run with a little margin.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0021",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "text": "That math works. I'd just flag that the $4k transfers number assumes we don't end up needing a second van for luggage — if we do, that goes up.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0022",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "text": "Noted. We can revisit if the coach operator can't fit everything. Decision: the deposit pot is $48k, with $31k flights, $13k lodging, $4k transfers. Daniel, please reflect that in the trip cost sheet today.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0023",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "text": "On it.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0024",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:45:00Z",
          "text": "Last item — deadlines. I want to be thoughtful here, because if we set them too early families scramble to pay before they're ready, and if we set them too late the fares and rooms slip away from us. Where do we land?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0025",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:45:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "text": "My proposal is Jun 8 for final payment from every family — full balance, room choices locked — and then Jun 22 for the document and passport check. That gives everyone two weeks after paying to get passports, insurance, and entry paperwork squared away.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0026",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "text": "I like that. The two-week gap between payment and documents worked well for us on the last two group trips.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0027",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "text": "Agreed. Decision: Jun 8 final payment, Jun 22 document and passport check. Mei, you'll own the document checklist?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0028",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "text": "Yes.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0029",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "text": "And Daniel, you'll own the transfers booking — the Lisbon airport pickup and the Porto-to-Seville coach — in coordination with Rob on paying the operator out of the pot?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0030",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "text": "Yep, I'll loop Rob in this week.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0031",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "text": "Perfect. Quick sanity check on action items — Mei: flight hold request by Friday, document checklist owner. Daniel: room allocation, trip cost sheet update today, transfers booking with Rob. Me: I'll update Rob and Leila on the carrier decision and the dates. Anything I'm missing?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0032",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "text": "I think that covers it.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0033",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "text": "One thing — do we want to set a regular check-in between now and Jun 8? I'd suggest weekly for the next few weeks given how much we have to lock down.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0034",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "text": "Good call. Same time next Wednesday, and I'll keep this slot held through Jun 3.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0035",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "text": "Works.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0036",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:52:00Z",
          "text": "Works.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0037",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:52:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "text": "One more thing while I have you both — on the itinerary itself, are we still aligned that the group booking is the core Lisbon, Porto, Seville route, and any side trips are optional add-ons each family books on their own? I don't want the group booking to sprawl before we've locked the core.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0038",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "text": "Aligned. Core route only for the group booking. Side trips are on each family.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0039",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:54:00Z",
          "text": "Same.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0040",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:54:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "text": "Great. And on the document checklist — passport validity, entry authorization, and proof of cover under the Allianz Travel group policy. Anything else you want on there?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0041",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "text": "I'd add a quick contact form due with the checklist — just three things, an emergency contact, a mobile number that works abroad, and any seating or room requests.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0042",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "text": "Plus one on that. Easy to collect, useful.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0043",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "text": "Added. So the checklist: passport validity, entry authorization, insurance cover, and the contact form. Mei, please add those to the trip brief.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0044",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "text": "Will do.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0045",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "text": "Okay — anything else for either of you before I let you go?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0046",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "text": "Nothing from me.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0047",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "text": "Nothing here.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0048",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "text": "Okay, I think that's everything on my list — let's wrap here. Thanks everyone for staying focused.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0049",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "text": "Thanks Sofia — good session.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0050",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:00Z",
          "text": "Yeah, productive. Talk soon!",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0051",
          "participant_id": "participantid-sofia",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:06Z",
          "text": "Alright, I have to jump to my 11 — talk soon.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0052",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:06Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:22Z",
          "text": "Did the Trip HQ link drop you in the waiting room too? I sat there for a couple of minutes thinking I had the wrong one.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0053",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:22Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:44Z",
          "text": "Yeah, Sofia reset the room this morning. Something about the passcode. I just used the new invite.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0054",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:44Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:06Z",
          "text": "Have you looked at the Seville forecast for July? I saw a forty-degree week last summer.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0055",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:06Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:28Z",
          "text": "I did. I'm planning everything outdoors before noon, and the afternoons are for the pool.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0056",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:28Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:50Z",
          "text": "Have you figured out packing yet? I tried the carry-on-only thing for a long weekend and still had to check a bag.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0057",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:50Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:12Z",
          "text": "Same thing happened to me. I bought packing cubes after that. The kids' stuff doesn't compress though.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0058",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:12Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:34Z",
          "text": "And I can't find my travel adapters again. I dug through two drawers before I remembered I lent them out.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0059",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:34Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:56Z",
          "text": "That's the second time you've lost them. I've started keeping mine taped inside the suitcase.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0060",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:56Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:02:28Z",
          "text": "Anyway. That shared packing list from last month is still sitting in my inbox. I keep meaning to open the spreadsheet they attached.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0061",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:02:28Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:03:00Z",
          "text": "I skimmed it. There's a tab for the Porto room block now too. A lot of names to keep straight.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0062",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:03:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "text": "God, I'm stressed. Honestly all this document-deadline talk is hitting close to home — my passport renewal is stuck. I applied in February, it still says 'in process', and my current one expires in September, so it won't meet the three-months-past-departure rule.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0063",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "text": "It's funny, I keep thinking I should have figured this out by now — I've been traveling internationally for almost twelve years and I still left the renewal too late.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0064",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "text": "Oof. That sounds rough. Where does it stand now?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0065",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "text": "I filed an expedite request last week. And because the new passport number isn't issued yet, my ETIAS application is just sitting there — I can't submit it on the old number. I keep telling myself it'll come through.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0066",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "text": "Oh, I've got my own mess, honestly. I'm thinking of splitting off to Madrid after Seville for a few days to see my sister, and I have no idea yet how that works with the group return flight.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0067",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "text": "Yeah. And I haven't raised this with everyone yet, but my mom is going to need wheelchair assistance at the Lisbon and Seville airports and a step-free room — the Porto hotel has stairs up to the annex. And if the passport doesn't come in time, I'm thinking of flying home separately after Porto instead of doing Seville.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0068",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "text": "I've been thinking about Madrid the same way. I'd rather book my own leg out of Seville than try to change the group ticket. Half the families probably have something like this going on.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0069",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:07:00Z",
          "text": "Yeah. We should actually use the flexibility we built into this, huh.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0070",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:07:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:07:00Z",
          "text": "Ha — right? And honestly the change fee for dropping the Seville leg on your group ticket is going to sting — I'd ask Rob to front it from the $48k pot if I were you, and pay it back after. Your family shouldn't eat that on top of the rebooking.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0071",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:07:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:07:00Z",
          "text": "Maybe. Anyway — want to talk it through properly later this week? I should have heard back on the expedite by then.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0072",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:07:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:08:00Z",
          "text": "Yes please. Thursday afternoon?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0073",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:08:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:08:00Z",
          "text": "Thursday works. I'll text you.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0074",
          "participant_id": "participantid-mei",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:08:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:08:00Z",
          "text": "Anyway, I should head out — see you on the next call.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0075",
          "participant_id": "participantid-daniel",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:08:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:08:00Z",
          "text": "Yeah, take care.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        }
      ]
    },
